cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework, cite it as below."
title: "The Invariant Stack: Seven Physics-Level Rules Governing Manifold Traversal and Collapse"
abstract: >-
  Seven invariants governing how any information-processing system traverses
  a manifold, resolves uncertainty, and collapses. Tier 1 invariants (INV-01
  through INV-06, PI-01) are domain-agnostic boundary conditions. Tier 2
  collapse operators and Tier 2.5 physical operators are derived from Tier 1
  with no free parameters. The framework is stated as falsifiable at every
  tier: one clean counterexample breaks the generative claim.
